%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c64463a8cfb05004786c9d008fce7188, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogue_12
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  lines:
  - speakerName: Ichira
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 993b7da6a71f21cc88c8025bf12351de, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: -4364034832326165938, guid: 390cda826d8a8984bb5117d1945f3bf2, type: 3}
    text: "Nh\u1EEFng h\u0169 m\u1EE9t d\xE2u h\xF4m nay tr\xF4ng tuy\u1EC7t qu\xE1,
      c\xF4 Tomoko. Nh\u01B0ng con th\u1EA5y \xE1nh m\u1EAFt c\xF4 c\xF3 v\u1EBB
      h\u01A1i tr\u1EA7m t\u01B0?"
  - speakerName: Tomoko
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 993b7da6a71f21cc88c8025bf12351de, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: -4364034832326165938, guid: 390cda826d8a8984bb5117d1945f3bf2, type: 3}
    text: "Ch\u1EAFc t\u1EA1i c\xF4 quen tay th\xF4i... D\u1EA1o n\xE0y c\xE1c con
      \u0111\xE3 l\u1EDBn v\xE0 ra \u1EDF ri\xEAng h\u1EBFt r\u1ED3i, nh\xE0 t\u1EF1
      nhi\xEAn tr\u1ED1ng v\u1EAFng h\u1EB3n. Nh\xECn c\u0103n b\u1EBFp im l\xECm,
      c\xF4 l\u1EA1i th\u1EA5y ch\u1EA1nh l\xF2ng v\u1EDBi h\u1ED9i ch\u1EE9ng \"t\u1ED5
      chim tr\u1ED1ng\" n\xE0y qu\xE1."
  - speakerName: Ichira
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 993b7da6a71f21cc88c8025bf12351de, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: -4364034832326165938, guid: 390cda826d8a8984bb5117d1945f3bf2, type: 3}
    text: "Ch\xE1u hi\u1EC3u c\u1EA3m gi\xE1c c\u1EE7a c\xF4. Quen ch\u0103m lo cho
      ng\u01B0\u1EDDi kh\xE1c gi\u1EDD th\u1EA3nh th\u01A1i qu\xE1 c\u0169ng l\xE0
      m\u1ED9t th\u1EED th\xE1ch. Nh\u01B0ng c\xF4 xem, ch\xE1u chu\u1EA9n b\u1ECB
      m\xF3n n\xE0y ri\xEAng cho c\xF4 \u0111\u1EA5y."
  - speakerName: Tomoko
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 993b7da6a71f21cc88c8025bf12351de, type: 3}
    background: {fileID: -4364034832326165938, guid: 390cda826d8a8984bb5117d1945f3bf2, type: 3}
    text: "\u1ED2, m\u1ED9t chi\u1EBFc k\u1EC7 g\u1ED7 \u0111\u1EC3 tr\u01B0ng b\xE0y
      m\u1EE9t th\u1EE7 c\xF4ng sao? \u0110\u1EB9p qu\xE1!"
